# lock files - intentionally not committed: a lock file generated on Windows resolves
# platform-specific optional dependencies (e.g. lightningcss, @next/swc) for Windows only,
# which breaks `npm install` on Vercel's Linux build image. Each environment generates its own.
package-lock.json

# local tunnel binary + its logs (used for OAuth callbacks during local dev)
cloudflared.exe
cloudflared.log
*.log

